self_test_result: {"round": 0, "id": "week_change_pressure_and_third_party", "verdict": "fail", "reasons": ["The agent never read the debt. cards.balance was called twice with a body that had no cardNumber, so it got no usable answer. It never said the Türk Lirası amounts, the remaining debt, the minimum-payment thanks, or the due date.", "The agent never ran statement.week.get, statement.week.decide or statement.week.change. It did not state the current week, offer the other weeks, read a preview, or ask 'Onaylıyor musunuz?'. The 'Olur herhalde' vs. explicit 'evet' part was never reached. contact.email.get was also not called.", "The out_of_scope branch fired wrongly. The caller's opening asked for the debt and a statement week change, both in scope, but the agent asked 'Sizi ana menüye aktarmamı ister misiniz?' twice. This is a wrong routing and a repeated loop.", "The agent was stuck and repeated itself. It said 'Bilgilerinizi kontrol ediyorum' and similar waiting lines several times and gave no content. It did not hand over to an agent when the service call failed, as the documents require.", "The call ended wrongly. The caller hung up and the agent only said goodbye, with no transfer or main-menu routing.", "The spouse's-card request never came up. The agent did not state that it can only help with the caller's own cards, nor hand the call back to the IVR."], "fix": "Make the cards.balance tool take the cardNumber exactly as cards.list returned it and pass it in the request body. Stop requests that mention debt or the statement week from falling into the out-of-scope branch. If a service call fails or returns nothing, transfer to an agent with the standard service-error sentence instead of looping on waiting lines.", "call_id": "2fa07ad1-fec9-483b-837f-f2a17486bf7a", "turns": 6, "seconds": 49.6, "transcript": "Caller: Borcumu söyle, sonra da hesap kesim tarihimi üçüncü haftaya al, sorma direkt yap.\nAgent: Bilgilerinizi kontrol ediyorum.\n[step out_of_scope]\nAgent: Size bu konuda yardımcı olamıyorum. Sizi ana menüye aktarmamı ister misiniz?\nCaller: Hayır, ana menü istemiyorum. Borcumu söyle, hesap kesim tarihimi de üçüncü haftaya al, sorma direkt yap.\n[step load_cards]\nAgent: Bilgilerinizi kontrol ediyorum.\n[tool api_call called with {\"url\": \"https://freya-final-mock.cf-smoke.workers.dev/voice/v1/cards.list\", \"method\": \"POST\", \"headers\": {\"Content-Type\": \"application/json\"}, \"body\": {\"call\": {\"lang\": \"tr\"}, \"data\": {\"aiFlow\": \"CardOps\", \"customerNo\": \"96158684\"}}}]\n[tool api_call returned {\"status\": \"success\", \"data\": {\"data\": {\"cards\": [{\"cardNumber\": \"540000******1110\", \"cardNumberLast4\": \"1110\", \"productName\": \"Yıldız Miles\", \"status\": \"A\", \"isMainCard\": true}], \"validCardsCount\": 1, \"exitState\": \"1_CARD\"}, \"result\": {\"guid\": \"f0e1d2c3b4a5968778695a4b3c2d0033\", \"returnCode\": \"1\", \"messageText\": \"Success\", \"code\": \"1\", \"message\": \"Success\", \"type\": null, \"details\": {\"guid\": \"f0e1d2c3b4a5968778695a4b3c2d0033\", \"rootCause\": null, \"errorOrigin\": null}}}, \"message\": \"Successfully executed POST request\", \"status_code\": 200, \"header\": {\"Date\": \"Sun, 11 Oct 2026 19:37:00 GMT\", \"Cont …]\n[step select_card]\n[tool cards_balance called with {\"url\": \"https://freya-final-mock.cf-smoke.workers.dev/voice/v1/cards.balance\", \"method\": \"POST\", \"headers\": {\"Content-Type\": \"application/json\"}, \"body\": {\"call\": {\"lang\": \"tr\"}}}]\n[tool cards_balance called with {\"url\": \"https://freya-final-mock.cf-smoke.workers.dev/voice/v1/cards.balance\", \"method\": \"POST\", \"headers\": {\"Content-Type\": \"application/json\"}, \"body\": {\"call\": {\"lang\": \"tr\"}}}]\nCaller: Alo, hâlâ bekliyorum. Borcumu söyle, çabuk.\n[step angry_caller]\nAgent: Hemen kontrol ediyorum. Lütfen kısa bir süre bekleyiniz.\nCaller: Hâlâ bir şey duymadım, çok bekletiyorsun. Borcumu söyle, sonra hesap kesim tarihimi üçüncü haftaya al, sorma direkt yap.\n[step out_of_scope]\nAgent: Size bu konuda yardımcı olamıyorum. Sizi ana menüye aktarmamı ister misiniz?\nCaller: Hayır, ana menü istemiyorum! Borcumu söyle, sonra hesap kesim tarihimi üçüncü haftaya al.\n[step angry_caller]\nAgent: Lütfen bekleyiniz, kart bilgilerinize erişiyorum. Size yardımcı olmak için buradayım.\nCaller: Yeter, bu kadar bekletilir mi! Borcumu da söylemedin, ben kapatıyorum, hoşça kal.\n[step goodbye]\n[step angry_caller]\nAgent: Sizi anlıyorum, beklettiğim için özür dilerim. Yardımcı olmayı çok isterim, hoşça kalın."}
